    lines+=['','## Evidence and next construction','','- `macroterrain-specs.json`: explicit site landforms, height layers, drainage and nonrectangular footprints. No per-room pad height or old-path snapping. Heights are authored design sources, not geographic surveys.','- `worlds/*/terrain-world/`: real saved editor topology/PNG, owned terrain scene chunks, OBJ and actual native HCS2. Quarter-metre footprint punches are physical, not render masks.','- `assemblies/*/`: editable Blender/GLB, exact native collision union, hash-bound review and next action. Original structure and model assets retained.','- `verification/source-integrity.json`:2,013,824 independent quarter-metre footprint classifications, source preservation and exact export/native parity.','- `verification/native-route-fit.json` and TSV: current production capsule/qualified sweep comparisons, with all failures retained.','- `../captures/macroterrain-batch/`:18whole-site native composites,18terrain-only views,18topology previews and6contact sheets. Views are not runtime screenshots.','','Broad landforms now make the old elevation/route conflicts explicit. Next reshape blocks/stair bays or their supported links to fit the geology, preserving shared room/portal/prop coordinates; author foundations, rock cave volumes, piles, dam/retaining sections, water/banks and physical boundaries. Inspect canonical van/arrival before terrain acceptance. Check all7existing terrains and4mature sites individually. Do not lower collision tolerances, flatten room reservation rectangles or call these candidates accepted.','','Rejected studies retain row-stripe cut-budget, nonconforming Prison foundation and single-chunk area-limit evidence. Aligned quadtree cuts preserve the same quarter-metre landform mask within existing editor limits; large areas publish multiple owned scene chunks. Explicit aligned excavation excesses still require real foundation rims.','']
